Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:53:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] profiles: ios-27.0.1-24A446 AMFI init address and
 original-classes ABI

Both ported from the iPad17,3 profile to the iPhone17,2 kernelcache by
UniXNU-ishtar scripts/kc-port.py (fileset entry + segment offset, verified by
masked code and chained-pointer comparison). Collection slide is 0: the iPhone
fileset already sits at XNU's link address.
